hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"879","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Anas bin Malik ko kehte hue suna: Madina me ghabrahat phaili, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Abu Talha ke ek ghore ko aariyat liya jise Mandub kaha jata tha, phir aap ne us par sawari ki, phir jab aap wapas aaye to aap ne farmaya: Hum ne koi cheez nahi dekhi, aur beshak hum ne use samandar paya."
"880","Abu Nuaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah se, Nafi se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar apne bete ko lahn par marte the."
"881","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Kaseer Abu Muhammad se, Abdur Rahman bin Ajlan se, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab raziyallahu anhu do aadmiyon ke paas se guzre jo teer chala rahe the, to un me se ek ne dusre se kaha: Asabta, to Umar ne farmaya: Bura lahn bura nishana lagane se zyada sakht hai."
"882","Ahmad bin Saleh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Anbasa bin Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Yahya bin Urwa bin Zubair ne khabar di, ke unhon ne Urwa bin Zubair ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zauja Aisha ne kaha: Logon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kahinon ke bare me pucha, to aap ne un se farmaya: Wo kuch nahi hain, to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, pas beshak wo kabhi koi baat bayan karte hain jo haq ho jati hai, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Wo haq me se ek baat hai jise shaitan uchak leta hai, phir use apne dost ke kaan me murghi ki qarqar ki tarah qarqar karta hai, phir wo us me sau se zyada jhoot mila dete hain."
"883","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Sabit al-Bunani se, Anas bin Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne ek safar me the, to haadi ne hadi khwani ki, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Anjasha, tujh par afsos, sheeshiyon ke sath narmi kar."
"884","Hasan bin Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mutamir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha mere walid ne: Ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, Umar se, mere khayal me mere walid ko shak hua, ke unhon ne kaha: Aadmi ke jhoot hone ke liye yehi kafi hai ke wo har suni hui baat bayan kare."
"885","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, Mutarrif bin Abdullah bin Shikhkhir se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Imran bin Husain ke sath Basra tak safar kiya, to hum par koi din nahi guzra magar unhon ne us me hamein sher sunaya, aur kaha: Beshak ghuma phira kar baat kehne me jhoot se bachne ki gunjaish hai."
"886","Abdullah bin Saleh ne kaha: Mujhe Musa bin Ali ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, Amr bin Aas se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe us aadmi par taajjub hua jo taqdeer se bhagta hai halanke wo us me padne wala hai, aur apne bhai ki aankh me tinkha dekhta hai aur apni aankh me shahteer chhor deta hai, aur apne bhai ke dil se keena nikalta hai aur apne dil me keena rehne deta hai, aur maine apna raaz kisi ke paas nahi rakha phir use zaahir karne par use malamat ki, aur main use kaise malamat karun jabke main khud us se tang pad chuka tha."
"887","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mere bhai ne bayan kiya, Sulaiman bin Bilal se, Alqama bin Abi Alqama se, apni walida se, Aisha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Ek museebat zada aadmi aurton ke paas se guzra, to wo us par hanste hue us ka mazaq udane lageen, to un me se baaz ko museebat pahunchi."
"888","Bishr bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Abdullah ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Sad bin Said al-Ansari ne khabar di, Zuhri se, Qabeela Bali ke ek aadmi se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas apne walid ke sath aaya, to mere walid ne mujhe chhor kar aap se sargoshi ki, unhon ne kaha: To maine apne walid se kaha: Unhon ne aap se kya kaha, unhon ne kaha: Jab tum kisi kaam ka irada karo to tum par tahammul lazim hai yahan tak ke Allah tumhe us me se nikalne ka rasta dikhaye, ya Allah tumhare liye nikalne ka rasta bana de."
"889","Aur Hasan bin Amr al-Fuqaimi se, Munzir al-Thawri se, Muhammad Ibn al-Hanafiya se, unhon ne kaha: Wo danishmand nahi jo bhale tareeqe se us ke sath guzara na kare jis ke sath guzare baghair chara na ho, yahan tak ke Allah us ke liye kushadgi ya nikalne ka rasta bana de."
"890","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fazari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qinan bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin Awsaja se, Bara bin Azib se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Jis ne doodh dene wala janwar atiya kiya ya gali ka rasta bataya, ya kaha: Raste ka, to us ke liye ek jaan azad karne ke barabar sawab hai."
"891","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Raja ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ikrima bin Ammar ne humein khabar di, Abu Zumail se, Malik bin Marsad se, un ke walid se, Hazrat Abu Zarr se, woh ise marfu qarar dete hain, unhon ne kaha: phir is ke baad unhon ne kaha: main nahi janta magar ye ke unhon ne ise marfu kiya, unhon ne kaha: tumhara apne dol se apne bhai ke dol me dalna sadaqa hai, aur tumhara neki ka hukm dena aur burai se rokna sadaqa hai, aur tumhara apne bhai ke chehre par muskurana sadaqa hai, aur tumhara logon ke raste se pathar aur kanta aur haddi hatana tumhare liye sadaqa hai, aur bhatka dene wali zameen me admi ko rasta batana tumhare liye sadaqa hai."
